 <h1> Who is Saul Bass?</h1>
 <h3> Saul Bass born May 8, 1920 - April 25, 1996 was a Graphic designer and film maker. Many people know him for his design of posters and title sequences. Bass worked for some of the best hollywood filmmakers, Including Alfred Hitchcock, Stanley kubrick, and Otto Preminger.

